<title>UK: SOCCER-WORLD CUP ASIAN ZONE QUALIFIERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-WORLD CUP ASIAN ZONE QUALIFIERS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on Thursday of World Cup soccer Asian zone qualifiers:</p>
<p>In Oman:</p>
<p>Japan 6 Nepal 0</p>
<p>Oman 4 Macao 0</p>
<p>In Jeddah:</p>
<p>Taiwan 0 Malaysia 0</p>
<p>Saudi Arabia 3 Bangladesh 0</p>
</text>
